{"seq":84,"slug":"dart-language-async","title":"Dart 语言与异步编程","stage":"DONE","category":"languages","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/dart-language-async","rating":{"composite":4.24,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.4,"coverage":3.75,"positioning":4.5,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"dart-语言与异步编程\">Dart 语言与异步编程</h1><p>Dart 从 Google 的浏览器脚本语言起步，经过十余年演进已成为覆盖移动端、服务端、命令行与 WebAssembly 的全栈开发语言。2023 年 Dart 3.0 引入 Records、Patterns 和 Class Modifiers 三大革命性特性，到 2026 年 5 月的 Dart 3.12 持续添加 private named parameters、dot shorthands 等语法糖，类型系统的表达力已接近 Kotlin 和 Swift。与此同时，Dart 独特的 Isolate 并发模型正在从「完全隔离」向「受控共享内存」演进——<code>dart:concurrent</code> 库、<code>@pragma(&#39;vm:shared&#39;)</code> 注解和 <code>NativeCallable.isolateGroupBound</code> 标志着多线程能力的质变。</p>\n<p>本 hub 聚焦 <strong>Dart 语言本身</strong>——类型系统设计哲学、异步与并发原语、核心标准库、以及工具生态。读者完成本 hub 后，应具备独立编写高质量 Dart 包、设计健壮异步管道和调用原生代码的能力。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与相邻-hub-的分工\">与相邻 hub 的分工</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>flutter-development</strong>：Flutter UI 框架层（Widget 树、状态管理、平台通道）。本 hub 讲语言根基，不涉及 Flutter SDK 特有 API。</li>\n<li><strong>typescript-fullstack</strong>：TypeScript 的类型体操与 Node.js 生态。两者同为「带类型的脚本语言」，但运行时模型截然不同——Dart 是 AOT/JIT 混合编译 + Isolate 隔离堆，TS 是单线程事件循环 + Worker 共享。</li>\n<li><strong>concurrency-models</strong>：跨语言并发范式的理论对比。本 hub 侧重 Dart Isolate 的实操细节。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径\">推荐学习路径</h2><ol>\n<li><strong>类型系统</strong>（第一章）→ 掌握空安全、类修饰符与模式匹配，打牢类型安全基础</li>\n<li><strong>异步与并发</strong>（第二章）→ 理解事件循环、Future/Stream 管道与 Isolate 并行</li>\n<li><strong>核心库</strong>（第三章）→ 学会集合操作、IO 网络编程和 FFI 原生互操作</li>\n<li><strong>生态工具</strong>（第四章）→ 掌握包管理、测试框架与服务端部署</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"前置知识\">前置知识</h2><ul>\n<li>至少一门静态类型语言（Java、TypeScript、Kotlin 等）的编程经验</li>\n<li>理解基本的事件驱动编程概念（回调、Promise/Future）</li>\n<li>对操作系统进程/线程模型有初步认知</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"../../languages/flutter-development/\">flutter-development</a> — Flutter 框架层实践</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../cs-fundamentals/concurrency-models/\">concurrency-models</a> — 跨语言并发范式对比</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../languages/typescript-fullstack/\">typescript-fullstack</a> — TypeScript 生态对比参考</li>\n</ul>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"type-system","title":"类型系统","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/dart-language-async/type-system","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"sound-null-safety","title":"健全空安全与类型系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/dart-language-async/type-system/sound-null-safety"},{"seq":2,"slug":"classes-mixins-extensions","title":"类、Mixin 与扩展","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/dart-language-async/type-system/classes-mixins-extensions"},{"seq":3,"slug":"pattern-matching-records","title":"模式匹配与 Records","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/dart-language-async/type-system/pattern-matching-records"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"async-concurrency","title":"异步与并发","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/dart-language-async/async-concurrency","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"future-async-await","title":"Future 与 async/await","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/dart-language-async/async-concurrency/future-async-await"},{"seq":2,"slug":"stream-reactive","title":"Stream 与响应式编程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/dart-language-async/async-concurrency/stream-reactive"},{"seq":3,"slug":"isolate-concurrency","title":"Isolate 并发模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/dart-language-async/async-concurrency/isolate-concurrency"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"core-libraries","title":"核心标准库","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/dart-language-async/core-libraries","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"collections-algorithms","title":"集合与算法库","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/dart-language-async/core-libraries/collections-algorithms"},{"seq":2,"slug":"dart-io-networking","title":"IO 与网络编程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/dart-language-async/core-libraries/dart-io-networking"},{"seq":3,"slug":"dart-ffi-interop","title":"FFI 与原生互操作","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/dart-language-async/core-libraries/dart-ffi-interop"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"ecosystem","title":"生态与工具链","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/dart-language-async/ecosystem","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"package-management-pub","title":"Pub 包管理与发布","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/dart-language-async/ecosystem/package-management-pub"},{"seq":2,"slug":"testing-debugging","title":"测试与调试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/dart-language-async/ecosystem/testing-debugging"},{"seq":3,"slug":"dart-server-backend","title":"Dart 服务端开发","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/dart-language-async/ecosystem/dart-server-backend"}]}]}